# OPTIONAL. Overrides where the "Open console" buttons point.
#
# Leave this unset and the page uses the production console:
#
#     https://code-modernisation.coreops.ai
#
# That is the default baked into the build, so a normal deploy needs no
# configuration at all. Set this only to aim a build somewhere else - a console
# running on your own machine, or a staging environment.
#
# Read at BUILD time, not at runtime: Vite writes the value into the JavaScript,
# so changing it means running `npm run build` again.

# VITE_CONSOLE_URL=http://localhost:8765
